review_text:
This game has an identity crysis, Is a bad RPG, bad shooter, bad roguelike, bad sousllike, bad looter etc. It fails in all the chapters that it wants to be in. I haven't played a worse game than this in years. I have no praise for it.

I think the idea is nice and it could be a cool game but the execution is just garbage even for an early access. I will even give some concrete examples from my 20 minutes gameplay:
- enemies spawn randomly, even behind you;
- no proper enemy introduction;
- no idea why do I get a boss that one shots me 2 minutes after I started playing;
- no idea why there is a portal to some kind of island and what the hell do I have to do there;
- enemies not only spot you at infinite range but they also shot you at infinite range;
- gameplay is walk... shoot...walk...shoot without much though to it;\
- no tutorial or at least some kind of introduction?!?
- any gameplay purpose?

I would revise this after EA is out; for now this is a mess.
